{"_id":"69712aed03b48b900bf6dc2f","roadmapSlug":"mlops","nodeId":"AjZHJcxUY29WZbCvr3zrs","description":"# Airflow\n\nAirflow is a platform used to programmatically author, schedule, and monitor workflows. It allows you to define workflows as Directed Acyclic Graphs (DAGs) of tasks, where each task represents a unit of work. Airflow then executes these tasks in the specified order, handling dependencies, retries, and logging along the way.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Airflow","url":"https://airflow.apache.org/","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa65b"},{"type":"official","title":"Airflow Docs","url":"https://airflow.apache.org/docs","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa65c"},{"type":"opensource","title":"airflow","url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa65d"},{"type":"article","title":"Building Pipelines In Apache Airflow ΓÇô For Beginners","url":"https://towardsdatascience.com/building-pipelines-in-apache-airflow-for-beginners-58f87a1512d5/?utm_source=roadmap&utm_medium=Referral&utm_campaign=TDS+roadmap+integration","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa65e"},{"type":"video","title":"What is Apache Airflow? For beginners","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CGxxVj13sOs","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa65f"},{"type":"video","title":"Apache Airflow Tutorial for Data Engineers","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y5rYZLBZ_Fw","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa660"},{"type":"feed","title":"Explore top posts about Apache Airflow","url":"https://app.daily.dev/tags/apache-airflow?ref=roadmapsh","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa661"}],"createdAt":"2026-01-21T19:37:17.786Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:05:22.994Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d04168aa","title":"DataCamp - MLOps Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/L0Ynzo"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/mlops/content/AjZHJcxUY29WZbCvr3zrs.md"}